ci-failure.prompt:
CI run failed on branch {{ branch }}.

Run URL: {{ run_url }}
Commit: {{ head_sha }}

Please run `gh run view {{ run_id }} --log-failed` to diagnose the error and prepare a fix.

ci-success.prompt:
Remote CI has passed on branch {{ branch }}.

Run URL: {{ run_url }}

Please check PR checks status and verify if it is ready to merge.

